  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Sector Management Adjustment Credit (PSMAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FYR MK PSALC WOULD (I) PROVIDE BUDGETARY SUPPORT FOR REFORM MEASURES TO BE ADOPTED BY THE GOVT PRIOR TO DISBURSEMENT; (II) SUPPORT FURTHER REFORMS IN PUBLIC SECTOR MGMT., PARTICULARLY PUBLIC ADMINISTRATION AND BUDGET MANAGEMENT; AND (III) SUPPLEMENT ONGOING REFORMS IN THE FINANCIAL AND PUBLIC ENTERPRISE AND SOCIAL SECTORS TOWARDS MORE EFFICIENT MANAGEMENT AND SOCIAL ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS AND PROTECTION OF THE POOR.</narrative>
  </description>
